73089	73156	73085	73086	Fra Luca	518	“ I have had a vision concerning thee . Thrice I have had it in the last two months : each time it has been clearer . Therefore I came from Fiesole , deeming it a message from heaven that I was bound to deliver . And I gather a promise of mercy to thee in this , that my breath is preserved in order to — ”
